window.I18N = {"en": {"code": "en", "name": "English", "html_lang": "en", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com (unofficial Pirate Token guide)", "h1": "Frequently Asked Questions", "subtitle": "Pirate Token · Treasure Hour · account safety", "banner_title": "🔒 The short version", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">We never ask for your Epic Games password</span> — not on this site, not in email, not in chat. There is no “account verification” that requires a password.", "Sign-in happens <span class=\"ok\">only on the official Epic Games page</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>) through the standard “Sign in with Epic Games” (OAuth) flow.", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com is not Epic Games.</span> It is an unofficial fan project — it is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Epic Games, Inc.", "If any site, DM, or “admin” asks for your password or a 2FA code — <span class=\"no\">that is a scam</span>. Close the page and report it."], "search_label": "Search the questions", "search_placeholder": "e.g. password, OAuth, 2FA, treasure hour…", "qa": [{"q": "Is fortyworth.com part of Epic Games?", "a": "<p>No. fortyworth.com is an independent, unofficial fan project built around the Fortnite Treasure Hunters event and the Pirate Shop Access Token. It is <strong>not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or connected to Epic Games, Inc. in any way</strong>, and it does not speak for Epic Games. “Fortnite” and “Epic Games” are trademarks of Epic Games, Inc.</p>"}, {"q": "Do you need my Epic Games password for anything?", "a": "<p>No — and there is no version of “account verification” that requires it. A password is only ever typed by <em>you</em>, on <em>Epic’s own site</em>, during the official sign-in flow (see the next question). Our site has no password field at all and cannot accept one.</p><p>If anyone — including someone claiming to be from fortyworth, Epic support, or a “verification bot” — asks you to hand over your password or a 2FA code, it is <strong>phishing</strong>. Real Epic Games staff will never ask either.</p>"}, {"q": "How does “Sign in with Epic Games” work?", "a": "<p>It uses OAuth, the same official mechanism used by thousands of apps:</p><ol><li>You click the <strong>Sign in with Epic Games</strong> button.</li><li>Your browser is redirected to <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> — the official Epic Games domain. You enter your credentials <strong>there</strong>, on Epic’s page, not on ours.</li><li>Epic asks which permissions the app requests and you approve them.</li><li>Epic sends our site a limited access token. It identifies your account (display name / account ID) — <strong>your password never leaves Epic’s servers</strong>, because you never type it on our site.</li></ol><p>You can revoke access at any time: Epic account → <strong>Connections → Apps</strong> → disconnect the app.</p>"}, {"q": "How do I check that I’m on the real Epic login page?", "a": "<p>Look at the address bar before typing anything. The only legitimate Epic login domain is <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> (note the <code>epicgames.com</code> part and the padlock).</p><p>Lookalike domains — for example <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — are fakes. If a site shows a login form <em>on its own page</em> instead of sending you to <code>epicgames.com</code>, do not type anything. When in doubt, open <code>epicgames.com</code> manually and sign in from there.</p>"}, {"q": "Someone asked for my password “to verify my account”. What do I do?", "a": "<p>Refuse and report. No legitimate service verifies accounts through passwords.</p><p>If you already shared it:</p><ol><li>Change your Epic password immediately at <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Enable two-factor authentication (see below).</li><li>Sign out of all sessions: Account → Password &amp; Security → sign out everywhere.</li><li>Check <strong>Connections → Apps</strong> and remove anything you do not recognize.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "What is the Pirate Token?", "a": "<p>The community name for the <strong>Pirate Shop Access Token</strong> — the event currency of the Treasure Hunters mini-season. You earn it by claiming high-tier Buried Pirate Chests and spend it in the pirate-themed shop. Our step-by-step guide lives in <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "What is Treasure Hour?", "a": "<p>A limited window during which the Treasure Hour badge goes live and high-tier chest odds improve. The live tracker is on the <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">fortyworth.com homepage</a>; confirmed schedule reports per region are collected in <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "How do I secure my Epic account?", "a": "<p>Four steps, five minutes:</p><ol><li>Turn on 2FA: <code>epicgames.com</code> → log in → Account → <strong>Password &amp; Security → Two-Factor Authentication</strong>. An authenticator app is the strongest option; email and SMS also work.</li><li>Use a unique password that you do not reuse anywhere else.</li><li>Never enter your password anywhere except <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Review <strong>Connections → Apps</strong> now and then and remove apps you no longer use.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Nothing matched your search — try a shorter word.", "checklist_title": "Account safety checklist", "cards": [{"title": "1. Never share your password", "text": "Not with “admins”, “support”, “verification bots”, streamers, or friends. Nobody legitimate will ever ask."}, {"title": "2. Check the domain", "text": "The only real Epic login page is <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>. Everything else that asks for credentials is fake."}, {"title": "3. Turn on 2FA", "text": "Epic account → Password &amp; Security → Two-Factor Authentication. A 2FA code is a key to your account — never tell it to anyone."}, {"title": "4. Review your connections", "text": "Account → Connections → Apps. Disconnect anything you do not use or do not recognize."}], "disclaimer": "<strong>Disclaimer:</strong> fortyworth.com is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or connected to Epic Games, Inc. “Fortnite”, “Epic Games” and their logos are trademarks of Epic Games, Inc.", "footer_guides_label": "Guides and community data:", "footer_tracker_label": "Live tracker:", "footer_official_label": "Official Epic Games site:"}, "es": {"code": "es", "name": "Español", "html_lang": "es", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com: Token Pirata y seguridad", "h1": "Preguntas frecuentes", "subtitle": "Token Pirata · Hora del Tesoro · seguridad de la cuenta", "banner_title": "🔒 Lo esencial", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Nunca te pedimos tu contraseña de Epic Games</span> — ni en este sitio, ni por correo, ni por chat. No existe ninguna “verificación de cuenta” que la requiera.", "El inicio de sesión ocurre <span class=\"ok\">solo en la página oficial de Epic Games</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>) mediante el flujo estándar “Iniciar sesión con Epic Games” (OAuth).", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com no es Epic Games.</span> Es un proyecto fan no oficial: no está afiliado a Epic Games, Inc., ni endosado, patrocinado o conectado a ella.", "Si cualquier sitio, mensaje directo o “admin” te pide tu contraseña o un código 2FA, <span class=\"no\">es una estafa</span>. Cierra la página y repórtalo."], "search_label": "Buscar en las preguntas", "search_placeholder": "p. ej.: contraseña, OAuth, 2FA, hora del tesoro…", "qa": [{"q": "¿fortyworth.com forma parte de Epic Games?", "a": "<p>No. fortyworth.com es un proyecto fan independiente y no oficial, creado en torno al evento Treasure Hunters de Fortnite y el Token Pirata (Pirate Shop Access Token). <strong>No está afiliado a Epic Games, Inc., ni endosado, patrocinado o conectado a ella de ninguna manera</strong>, y no habla en nombre de Epic Games. “Fortnite” y “Epic Games” son marcas registradas de Epic Games, Inc.</p>"}, {"q": "¿Necesitan mi contraseña de Epic Games para algo?", "a": "<p>No, y no existe ninguna versión de “verificación de cuenta” que la requiera. La contraseña solo la escribe <em>tú</em>, en el <em>sitio oficial de Epic</em>, durante el flujo de inicio de sesión oficial (mira la siguiente pregunta). Nuestro sitio no tiene ningún campo de contraseña y no puede aceptarla.</p><p>Si cualquiera — incluso alguien que diga ser de fortyworth, del soporte de Epic o un “bot de verificación” — te pide entregar tu contraseña o un código 2FA, es <strong>phishing</strong>. El personal real de Epic Games tampoco lo pediría jamás.</p>"}, {"q": "¿Cómo funciona “Iniciar sesión con Epic Games”?", "a": "<p>Usa OAuth, el mismo mecanismo oficial que utilizan miles de aplicaciones:</p><ol><li>Pulsas el botón <strong>Iniciar sesión con Epic Games</strong>.</li><li>Tu navegador te redirige a <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>, el dominio oficial de Epic Games. Tus datos los introduces <strong>ahí</strong>, en la página de Epic, no en la nuestra.</li><li>Epic te pregunta qué permisos solicita la app y los apruebas.</li><li>Epic envía a nuestro sitio un token de acceso limitado. Identifica tu cuenta (nombre visible / ID de cuenta): <strong>tu contraseña nunca sale de los servidores de Epic</strong>, porque nunca la escribes en nuestro sitio.</li></ol><p>Puedes revocar el acceso cuando quieras: cuenta de Epic → <strong>Conexiones → Apps</strong> → desconecta la app.</p>"}, {"q": "¿Cómo compruebo que estoy en la página real de inicio de sesión de Epic?", "a": "<p>Mira la barra de direcciones antes de escribir nada. El único dominio legítimo de inicio de sesión de Epic es <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> (fíjate en la parte <code>epicgames.com</code> y en el candado).</p><p>Los dominios imitadores — por ejemplo <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — son falsos. Si un sitio muestra un formulario de inicio de sesión <em>en su propia página</em> en lugar de enviarte a <code>epicgames.com</code>, no escribas nada. Ante la duda, abre <code>epicgames.com</code> manualmente e inicia sesión desde ahí.</p>"}, {"q": "Alguien me pidió la contraseña “para verificar mi cuenta”. ¿Qué hago?", "a": "<p>Niega y reporta. Ningún servicio legítimo verifica cuentas a través de contraseñas.</p><p>Si ya la compartiste:</p><ol><li>Cambia tu contraseña de Epic de inmediato en <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Activa la autenticación en dos pasos (más abajo).</li><li>Cierra todas las sesiones: Cuenta → Contraseña y seguridad → cerrar sesión en todos los dispositivos.</li><li>Revisa <strong>Conexiones → Apps</strong> y elimina lo que no reconozcas.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "¿Qué es el Token Pirata?", "a": "<p>Es el nombre que la comunidad le da al <strong>Pirate Shop Access Token</strong>, la moneda del evento de la mini temporada Treasure Hunters. La ganas abriendo cofres piratas enterrados de nivel alto y la gastas en la tienda pirata. Nuestra guía paso a paso está en <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "¿Qué es la Hora del Tesoro (Treasure Hour)?", "a": "<p>Una ventana limitada durante la cual se activa el badge de la Hora del Tesoro y mejoran las probabilidades de los cofres de nivel alto. El tracker en vivo está en la <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">portada de fortyworth.com</a>; los horarios confirmados por región se recopilan en <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "¿Cómo protejo mi cuenta de Epic?", "a": "<p>Cuatro pasos, cinco minutos:</p><ol><li>Activa la 2FA: <code>epicgames.com</code> → inicia sesión → Cuenta → <strong>Contraseña y seguridad → Autenticación en dos pasos</strong>. Una app de autenticación es la opción más segura; el correo y el SMS también valen.</li><li>Usa una contraseña única que no repitas en ningún otro sitio.</li><li>No introduzcas tu contraseña en ningún lugar que no sea <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Revisa <strong>Conexiones → Apps</strong> de vez en cuando y elimina las apps que ya no uses.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Ningún resultado coincide con tu búsqueda — prueba con una palabra más corta.", "checklist_title": "Checklist de seguridad de la cuenta", "cards": [{"title": "1. Nunca compartas tu contraseña", "text": "Ni con “admins”, “soporte”, “bots de verificación”, streamers ni amigos. Nadie legítimo te la pedirá jamás."}, {"title": "2. Comprueba el dominio", "text": "La única página real de inicio de sesión de Epic es <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>. Todo lo demás que pida credenciales es falso."}, {"title": "3. Activa la 2FA", "text": "Cuenta de Epic → Contraseña y seguridad → Autenticación en dos pasos. Un código 2FA es una llave de tu cuenta: jamás se lo digas a nadie."}, {"title": "4. Revisa tus conexiones", "text": "Cuenta → Conexiones → Apps. Desconecta lo que no uses o no reconozcas."}], "disclaimer": "fortyworth.com es un proyecto fan no oficial. No está afiliado a Epic Games, Inc., ni endosado, patrocinado o conectado a ella. “Fortnite”, “Epic Games” y sus logotipos son marcas registradas de Epic Games, Inc.", "footer_guides_label": "Guías y datos de la comunidad:", "footer_tracker_label": "Tracker en vivo:", "footer_official_label": "Sitio oficial de Epic Games:"}, "pt-BR": {"code": "pt-BR", "name": "Português (Brasil)", "html_lang": "pt-BR", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com: Token Pirata e segurança", "h1": "Perguntas frequentes", "subtitle": "Token Pirata · Hora do Tesouro · segurança da conta", "banner_title": "🔒 O essencial", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Nunca pedimos a sua senha da Epic Games</span> — nem neste site, nem por e-mail, nem no chat. Não existe “verificação de conta” nenhuma que precise de senha.", "O login acontece <span class=\"ok\">somente na página oficial da Epic Games</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>), pelo fluxo padrão “Entrar com a Epic Games” (OAuth).", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com não é a Epic Games.</span> É um projeto de fã não oficial: não é afiliado à Epic Games, Inc., nem endossado, patrocinado ou conectado a ela.", "Se qualquer site, DM ou “admin” pedir a sua senha ou um código 2FA, <span class=\"no\">é golpe</span>. Feche a página e denuncie."], "search_label": "Pesquisar nas perguntas", "search_placeholder": "ex.: senha, OAuth, 2FA, hora do tesouro…", "qa": [{"q": "O fortyworth.com faz parte da Epic Games?", "a": "<p>Não. O fortyworth.com é um projeto de fã independente e não oficial, feito em torno do evento Treasure Hunters do Fortnite e do Token Pirata (Pirate Shop Access Token). Ele <strong>não é afiliado à Epic Games, Inc., nem endossado, patrocinado ou conectado a ela de forma alguma</strong>, e não fala em nome da Epic Games. “Fortnite” e “Epic Games” são marcas registradas da Epic Games, Inc.</p>"}, {"q": "Vocês precisam da minha senha da Epic Games para algo?", "a": "<p>Não — e não existe nenhuma versão de “verificação de conta” que precise dela. A senha é digitada apenas por <em>você</em>, no <em>site oficial da Epic</em>, durante o fluxo de login oficial (veja a próxima pergunta). Nosso site não tem nenhum campo de senha e não consegue aceitar uma.</p><p>Se alguém — incluindo quem diga ser da fortyworth, do suporte da Epic ou um “bot de verificação” — pedir para você entregar a sua senha ou um código 2FA, é <strong>phishing</strong>. A equipe real da Epic Games também nunca pede isso.</p>"}, {"q": "Como funciona o “Entrar com a Epic Games”?", "a": "<p>Usa OAuth, o mesmo mecanismo oficial de milhares de apps:</p><ol><li>Você clica no botão <strong>Entrar com a Epic Games</strong>.</li><li>Seu navegador é redirecionado para <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>, o domínio oficial da Epic Games. Você digita as suas credenciais <strong>lá</strong>, na página da Epic, não na nossa.</li><li>A Epic pergunta quais permissões o app solicita e você as aprova.</li><li>A Epic envia ao nosso site um token de acesso limitado. Ele identifica a sua conta (nome de exibição / ID da conta) — <strong>a sua senha nunca sai dos servidores da Epic</strong>, porque você nunca a digita no nosso site.</li></ol><p>Você pode revogar o acesso a qualquer momento: conta Epic → <strong>Conexões → Apps</strong> → desconecte o app.</p>"}, {"q": "Como eu confiro que estou na página real de login da Epic?", "a": "<p>Olhe a barra de endereço antes de digitar qualquer coisa. O único domínio legítimo de login da Epic é <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> (repare na parte <code>epicgames.com</code> e no cadeado).</p><p>Domínios imitadores — por exemplo <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — são falsos. Se um site mostrar um formulário de login <em>na própria página dele</em> em vez de te mandar para <code>epicgames.com</code>, não digite nada. Na dúvida, abra <code>epicgames.com</code> manualmente e faça login por lá.</p>"}, {"q": "Alguém pediu a minha senha “para verificar a conta”. O que faço?", "a": "<p>Recuse e denuncie. Nenhum serviço legítimo verifica contas por meio de senhas.</p><p>Se você já compartilhou a senha:</p><ol><li>Troque a senha da Epic imediatamente em <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Ative a autenticação de dois fatores (veja abaixo).</li><li>Encerre todas as sessões: Conta → Senha e segurança → encerrar sessão em todos os lugares.</li><li>Confira <strong>Conexões → Apps</strong> e remova o que você não reconhecer.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "O que é o Token Pirata?", "a": "<p>É o nome que a comunidade dá ao <strong>Pirate Shop Access Token</strong>, a moeda do evento da mini temporada Treasure Hunters. Você o ganha resgatando baús piratas enterrados de tier alto e o gasta na loja pirata. Nosso guia passo a passo está em <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "O que é a Hora do Tesouro (Treasure Hour)?", "a": "<p>Uma janela limitada em que o badge da Hora do Tesouro fica ativo e as chances de baús de tier alto melhoram. O tracker ao vivo fica na <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">página inicial do fortyworth.com</a>; os cronogramas confirmados por região ficam reunidos em <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Como protejo a minha conta Epic?", "a": "<p>Quatro passos, cinco minutos:</p><ol><li>Ative a 2FA: <code>epicgames.com</code> → faça login → Conta → <strong>Senha e segurança → Autenticação de dois fatores</strong>. Um app autenticador é a opção mais forte; e-mail e SMS também funcionam.</li><li>Use uma senha única que você não repita em nenhum outro lugar.</li><li>Digite a sua senha somente em <code>epicgames.com</code>, nunca em outro lugar.</li><li>De vez em quando, revise <strong>Conexões → Apps</strong> e remova os apps que você não usa mais.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Nada encontrado para a sua pesquisa — tente uma palavra mais curta.", "checklist_title": "Checklist de segurança da conta", "cards": [{"title": "1. Nunca compartilhe a sua senha", "text": "Nem com “admins”, “suporte”, “bots de verificação”, streamers ou amigos. Ninguém legítimo vai pedir, nunca."}, {"title": "2. Confira o domínio", "text": "A única página real de login da Epic é <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>. Todo o resto que pedir credenciais é falso."}, {"title": "3. Ative a 2FA", "text": "Conta Epic → Senha e segurança → Autenticação de dois fatores. Um código 2FA é uma chave da sua conta — nunca conte a ninguém."}, {"title": "4. Revise as suas conexões", "text": "Conta → Conexões → Apps. Desconecte o que você não usa ou não reconhece."}], "disclaimer": "O fortyworth.com é um projeto de fã não oficial. Não é afiliado à Epic Games, Inc., nem endossado, patrocinado ou conectado a ela. “Fortnite”, “Epic Games” e seus logotipos são marcas registradas da Epic Games, Inc.", "footer_guides_label": "Guias e dados da comunidade:", "footer_tracker_label": "Tracker ao vivo:", "footer_official_label": "Site oficial da Epic Games:"}, "de": {"code": "de", "name": "Deutsch", "html_lang": "de", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com (inoffizieller Piraten-Token-Guide)", "h1": "Häufige Fragen", "subtitle": "Piraten-Token · Schatzstunde · Kontosicherheit", "banner_title": "🔒 Die Kurzfassung", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Wir fragen nie nach deinem Epic-Games-Passwort</span> — weder auf dieser Website, noch per E-Mail, noch im Chat. Es gibt keine „Konto-Verifizierung“, die ein Passwort verlangt.", "Die Anmeldung läuft <span class=\"ok\">nur auf der offiziellen Epic-Games-Seite</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>) über den Standard-Flow „Sign in with Epic Games“ (OAuth).", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com ist nicht Epic Games.</span> Es ist ein inoffizielles Fan-Projekt — nicht mit Epic Games, Inc. verbunden, nicht von Epic Games, Inc. unterstützt, gesponsert oder gebilligt.", "Wenn eine Website, eine DM oder ein „Admin“ nach deinem Passwort oder einem 2FA-Code fragt — <span class=\"no\">das ist Phishing</span>. Schließe die Seite und melde es."], "search_label": "Fragen durchsuchen", "search_placeholder": "z. B. Passwort, OAuth, 2FA, Schatzstunde …", "qa": [{"q": "Ist fortyworth.com Teil von Epic Games?", "a": "<p>Nein. fortyworth.com ist ein unabhängiges, inoffizielles Fan-Projekt rund um das Fortnite-Event Treasure Hunters und den Piraten-Token (Pirate Shop Access Token). Es ist <strong>in keiner Weise mit Epic Games, Inc. verbunden, von Epic Games, Inc. unterstützt, gesponsert oder gebilligt</strong> und spricht nicht für Epic Games. „Fortnite“ und „Epic Games“ sind Marken von Epic Games, Inc.</p>"}, {"q": "Braucht ihr mein Epic-Games-Passwort für irgendetwas?", "a": "<p>Nein — und es gibt keine Variante einer „Konto-Verifizierung“, die ein Passwort verlangt. Dein Passwort tippst nur <em>du</em> ein, und zwar auf der <em>eigenen Website von Epic</em>, während des offiziellen Anmelde-Vorgangs (siehe nächste Frage). Unsere Website hat gar kein Passwort-Feld und kann eines nicht annehmen.</p><p>Wenn jemand — auch jemand, der vorgibt, von fortyworth oder vom Epic-Support zu sein, oder ein „Verifikations-Bot“ — von dir verlangt, dein Passwort oder einen 2FA-Code herauszugeben, ist das <strong>Phishing</strong>. Echte Epic-Games-Mitarbeiter fragen genauso nie danach.</p>"}, {"q": "Wie funktioniert „Sign in with Epic Games“?", "a": "<p>Dabei wird OAuth verwendet — derselbe offizielle Mechanismus, den Tausende Apps nutzen:</p><ol><li>Du klickst auf den Button <strong>Sign in with Epic Games</strong>.</li><li>Dein Browser wird zu <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> weitergeleitet — der offiziellen Epic-Games-Domain. Deine Zugangsdaten gibst du <strong>dort</strong> ein, auf der Seite von Epic, nicht auf unserer.</li><li>Epic zeigt dir, welche Berechtigungen die App anfordert, und du stimmst ihnen zu.</li><li>Epic sendet unserer Website einen eingeschränkten Access-Token. Er identifiziert dein Konto (Anzeigename / Konto-ID) — <strong>dein Passwort verlässt nie die Server von Epic</strong>, weil du es auf unserer Website nie eintippst.</li></ol><p>Du kannst den Zugriff jederzeit widerrufen: Epic-Konto → <strong>Verbindungen → Apps</strong> → App trennen.</p>"}, {"q": "Wie prüfe ich, dass ich auf der echten Epic-Anmeldeseite bin?", "a": "<p>Wirf einen Blick in die Adressleiste, bevor du irgendwas eintippst. Die einzige legitime Epic-Anmelde-Domain ist <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> (achte auf den <code>epicgames.com</code>-Teil und das Schloss-Symbol).</p><p>Nachgeahmte Domains — zum Beispiel <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — sind Fälschungen. Wenn eine Website ein Anmeldeformular <em>auf ihrer eigenen Seite</em> zeigt, statt dich zu <code>epicgames.com</code> zu schicken, tippe gar nichts ein. Im Zweifel öffnest du <code>epicgames.com</code> manuell und meldest dich von dort an.</p>"}, {"q": "Jemand hat nach meinem Passwort gefragt, „um mein Konto zu verifizieren“. Was tue ich?", "a": "<p>Ablehnen und melden. Kein legitimer Dienst verifiziert Konten über Passwörter.</p><p>Wenn du es schon weitergegeben hast:</p><ol><li>Ändere dein Epic-Passwort sofort auf <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Aktiviere die Zwei-Faktor-Authentifizierung (siehe unten).</li><li>Melde dich von allen Sitzungen ab: Konto → Passwort &amp; Sicherheit → überall abmelden.</li><li>Prüfe <strong>Verbindungen → Apps</strong> und entferne alles, was du nicht erkennst.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "Was ist der Piraten-Token?", "a": "<p>Der Name aus der Community für den <strong>Piraten-Token (Pirate Shop Access Token)</strong> — die Event-Währung der Treasure-Hunters-Mini-Season. Du verdienst ihn, indem du hochstufige vergrabene Piraten-Truhen (Buried Pirate Chests) plünderst, und gibst ihn im Piraten-Shop aus. Unser Schritt-für-Schritt-Guide liegt in <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Was ist die Schatzstunde?", "a": "<p>Ein begrenztes Zeitfenster, in dem das Schatzstunden-Badge (Treasure Hour) live geht und die Chancen auf High-Tier-Truhen besser werden. Den Live-Tracker findest du auf der <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">fortyworth.com-Startseite</a>; bestätigte Zeitplan-Meldungen pro Region sammeln sich in <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Wie sichere ich mein Epic-Konto?", "a": "<p>Vier Schritte, fünf Minuten:</p><ol><li>Aktiviere 2FA: <code>epicgames.com</code> → anmelden → Konto → <strong>Passwort &amp; Sicherheit → Zwei-Faktor-Authentifizierung</strong>. Eine Authenticator-App ist die stärkste Option; E-Mail und SMS funktionieren auch.</li><li>Benutze ein einzigartiges Passwort, das du nirgendwo sonst wiederverwendest.</li><li>Gib dein Passwort nirgends ein außer auf <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Prüfe ab und zu <strong>Verbindungen → Apps</strong> und entferne Apps, die du nicht mehr nutzt.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Nichts gefunden — versuche es mit einem kürzeren Wort.", "checklist_title": "Checkliste für die Kontosicherheit", "cards": [{"title": "1. Gib dein Passwort nie weiter", "text": "Nicht an „Admins“, „Support“, „Verifikations-Bots“, Streamer oder Freunde. Niemand Legitimes fragt jemals danach."}, {"title": "2. Prüfe die Domain", "text": "Die einzige echte Epic-Anmeldeseite ist <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>. Alles andere, was nach Zugangsdaten fragt, ist gefälscht."}, {"title": "3. Aktiviere 2FA", "text": "Epic-Konto → Passwort &amp; Sicherheit → Zwei-Faktor-Authentifizierung. Ein 2FA-Code ist ein Schlüssel zu deinem Konto — sag ihn niemandem."}, {"title": "4. Prüfe deine Verbindungen", "text": "Konto → Verbindungen → Apps. Trenne alles, was du nicht nutzt oder nicht erkennst."}], "disclaimer": "<strong>Haftungshinweis:</strong> fortyworth.com ist ein inoffizielles Fan-Projekt. Es ist nicht mit Epic Games, Inc. verbunden, nicht von Epic Games, Inc. unterstützt, gesponsert oder gebilligt. „Fortnite“, „Epic Games“ und ihre Logos sind Marken von Epic Games, Inc.", "footer_guides_label": "Guides und Community-Daten:", "footer_tracker_label": "Live-Tracker:", "footer_official_label": "Offizielle Epic-Games-Website:"}, "fr": {"code": "fr", "name": "Français", "html_lang": "fr", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com (guide non officiel du Jeton Pirate)", "h1": "Foire aux questions", "subtitle": "Jeton Pirate · Heure du Trésor · sécurité du compte", "banner_title": "🔒 L'essentiel en bref", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Nous ne te demandons jamais ton mot de passe Epic Games</span> — ni sur ce site, ni par e-mail, ni sur le chat. Il n'existe aucune « vérification de compte » qui exige un mot de passe.", "La connexion se fait <span class=\"ok\">uniquement sur la page officielle d'Epic Games</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>) via le flux standard « Sign in with Epic Games » (OAuth).", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com n'est pas Epic Games.</span> C'est un projet de fans non officiel — sans affiliation, approbation, parrainage ni lien avec Epic Games, Inc.", "Si un site, un DM ou un « admin » te demande ton mot de passe ou un code 2FA — <span class=\"no\">c'est une arnaque</span>. Ferme la page et signale-la."], "search_label": "Rechercher dans les questions", "search_placeholder": "ex. mot de passe, OAuth, 2FA, heure du trésor…", "qa": [{"q": "fortyworth.com fait-il partie d'Epic Games ?", "a": "<p>Non. fortyworth.com est un projet de fans indépendant et non officiel, construit autour de l'événement Fortnite Treasure Hunters et du Jeton Pirate (Pirate Shop Access Token). Il n'est <strong>d'aucune manière affilié à Epic Games, Inc., approuvé, sponsorisé ou connecté à Epic Games, Inc.</strong> et ne parle pas au nom d'Epic Games. « Fortnite » et « Epic Games » sont des marques d'Epic Games, Inc.</p>"}, {"q": "As-tu besoin de mon mot de passe Epic Games pour quoi que ce soit ?", "a": "<p>Non — et il n'existe aucune version de « vérification de compte » qui en exige un. Le mot de passe n'est saisi que par <em>toi</em>, sur le <em>site officiel d'Epic</em>, pendant le flux de connexion officiel (voir la question suivante). Notre site n'a aucun champ de mot de passe et ne peut pas en accepter un.</p><p>Si quelqu'un — y compris une personne qui prétend venir de fortyworth ou du support Epic, ou un « bot de vérification » — te demande de lui remettre ton mot de passe ou un code 2FA, c'est du <strong>phishing</strong>. Le vrai personnel d'Epic Games ne le demande jamais non plus.</p>"}, {"q": "Comment fonctionne « Sign in with Epic Games » ?", "a": "<p>Cela utilise OAuth, le même mécanisme officiel que des milliers d'applications :</p><ol><li>Tu cliques sur le bouton <strong>Sign in with Epic Games</strong>.</li><li>Ton navigateur est redirigé vers <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> — le domaine officiel d'Epic Games. Tu saisis tes identifiants <strong>là</strong>, sur la page d'Epic, pas sur la nôtre.</li><li>Epic t'indique quelles autorisations l'application demande, et tu les approuves.</li><li>Epic envoie à notre site un jeton d'accès limité. Il identifie ton compte (nom d'affichage / ID de compte) — <strong>ton mot de passe ne quitte jamais les serveurs d'Epic</strong>, car tu ne le tapes jamais sur notre site.</li></ol><p>Tu peux révoquer l'accès à tout moment : compte Epic → <strong>Connexions → Apps</strong> → déconnecter l'application.</p>"}, {"q": "Comment vérifier que je suis sur la vraie page de connexion Epic ?", "a": "<p>Regarde la barre d'adresse avant de taper quoi que ce soit. Le seul domaine de connexion Epic légitime est <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> (note la partie <code>epicgames.com</code> et le cadenas).</p><p>Les domaines imitateurs — par exemple <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — sont des faux. Si un site affiche un formulaire de connexion <em>sur sa propre page</em> au lieu de t'envoyer vers <code>epicgames.com</code>, ne tape rien. En cas de doute, ouvre <code>epicgames.com</code> manuellement et connecte-toi depuis là.</p>"}, {"q": "On m'a demandé mon mot de passe « pour vérifier mon compte ». Que faire ?", "a": "<p>Refuse et signale. Aucun service légitime ne vérifie les comptes via des mots de passe.</p><p>Si tu l'as déjà partagé :</p><ol><li>Change ton mot de passe Epic immédiatement sur <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Active l'authentification à deux facteurs (voir plus bas).</li><li>Déconnecte toutes les sessions : Compte → Mot de passe et sécurité → déconnexion partout.</li><li>Vérifie <strong>Connexions → Apps</strong> et supprime tout ce que tu ne reconnais pas.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "Qu'est-ce que le Jeton Pirate ?", "a": "<p>Le nom que la communauté donne au <strong>Jeton Pirate (Pirate Shop Access Token)</strong> — la monnaie de l'événement de la mini-saison Treasure Hunters. Tu le gagnes en récupérant des coffres pirates enfouis (Buried Pirate Chests) de haut niveau et tu le dépenses dans la boutique sur le thème des pirates. Notre guide pas à pas se trouve dans <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Qu'est-ce que l'Heure du Trésor ?", "a": "<p>Une fenêtre limitée pendant laquelle le badge Heure du Trésor (Treasure Hour) passe en direct et où les chances de coffres de haut niveau augmentent. Le tracker en direct est sur la <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">page d'accueil de fortyworth.com</a> ; les rapports d'horaires confirmés par région sont rassemblés dans <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Comment sécuriser mon compte Epic ?", "a": "<p>Quatre étapes, cinq minutes :</p><ol><li>Active la 2FA : <code>epicgames.com</code> → connexion → Compte → <strong>Mot de passe et sécurité → Authentification à deux facteurs</strong>. Une application d'authentification est l'option la plus solide ; l'e-mail et le SMS fonctionnent aussi.</li><li>Utilise un mot de passe unique que tu ne réutilises nulle part ailleurs.</li><li>Ne saisis ton mot de passe nulle part ailleurs que sur <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>De temps en temps, vérifie <strong>Connexions → Apps</strong> et supprime les applications que tu n'utilises plus.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Aucun résultat — essaie avec un mot plus court.", "checklist_title": "Checklist de sécurité du compte", "cards": [{"title": "1. Ne partage jamais ton mot de passe", "text": "Ni avec des « admins », le « support », des « bots de vérification », des streamers ou des amis. Personne de légitime ne le demandera jamais."}, {"title": "2. Vérifie le domaine", "text": "La seule vraie page de connexion Epic est <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>. Tout le reste qui demande des identifiants est un faux."}, {"title": "3. Active la 2FA", "text": "Compte Epic → Mot de passe et sécurité → Authentification à deux facteurs. Un code 2FA est une clé de ton compte — ne le dis jamais à personne."}, {"title": "4. Vérifie tes connexions", "text": "Compte → Connexions → Apps. Déconnecte tout ce que tu n'utilises pas ou ne reconnais pas."}], "disclaimer": "<strong>Avertissement :</strong> fortyworth.com est un projet de fans non officiel. Il n'est ni affilié à Epic Games, Inc., ni approuvé, sponsorisé ou connecté à Epic Games, Inc. « Fortnite », « Epic Games » et leurs logos sont des marques d'Epic Games, Inc.", "footer_guides_label": "Guides et données de la communauté :", "footer_tracker_label": "Tracker en direct :", "footer_official_label": "Site officiel d'Epic Games :"}, "it": {"code": "it", "name": "Italiano", "html_lang": "it", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com (guida non ufficiale al Token Pirata)", "h1": "Domande frequenti", "subtitle": "Token Pirata · Ora del Tesoro · sicurezza dell'account", "banner_title": "🔒 In breve", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Non chiediamo mai la tua password Epic Games</span> — né su questo sito, né via email, né in chat. Non esiste alcuna «verifica dell'account» che richieda una password.", "L'accesso avviene <span class=\"ok\">solo sulla pagina ufficiale di Epic Games</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>) tramite il flusso standard «Sign in with Epic Games» (OAuth).", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com non è Epic Games.</span> È un progetto fan non ufficiale — non affiliato, approvato, sponsorizzato o collegato in alcun modo a Epic Games, Inc.", "Se un sito, un DM o un «admin» ti chiede la password o un codice 2FA — <span class=\"no\">è una truffa</span>. Chiudi la pagina e segnala."], "search_label": "Cerca nelle domande", "search_placeholder": "es. password, OAuth, 2FA, ora del tesoro…", "qa": [{"q": "fortyworth.com fa parte di Epic Games?", "a": "<p>No. fortyworth.com è un progetto fan indipendente e non ufficiale, costruito attorno all'evento Fortnite Treasure Hunters e al Token Pirata (Pirate Shop Access Token). Non è <strong>affiliato, approvato, sponsorizzato o collegato in alcun modo a Epic Games, Inc.</strong> e non parla per conto di Epic Games. «Fortnite» ed «Epic Games» sono marchi di Epic Games, Inc.</p>"}, {"q": "Vi serve la mia password Epic Games per qualcosa?", "a": "<p>No — e non esiste alcuna versione di «verifica dell'account» che la richieda. La password viene digitata solo da <em>te</em>, sul <em>sito ufficiale di Epic</em>, durante il flusso di accesso ufficiale (vedi la domanda successiva). Il nostro sito non ha alcun campo password e non può accettarne uno.</p><p>Se qualcuno — incluso chi dice di essere di fortyworth o dell'assistenza Epic, o un «bot di verifica» — ti chiede di consegnare la tua password o un codice 2FA, è <strong>phishing</strong>. Nemmeno il vero staff di Epic Games lo chiede mai.</p>"}, {"q": "Come funziona «Sign in with Epic Games»?", "a": "<p>Usa OAuth, lo stesso meccanismo ufficiale usato da migliaia di app:</p><ol><li>Fai clic sul pulsante <strong>Sign in with Epic Games</strong>.</li><li>Il tuo browser viene reindirizzato a <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> — il dominio ufficiale di Epic Games. Le tue credenziali le inserisci <strong>lì</strong>, sulla pagina di Epic, non sulla nostra.</li><li>Epic ti mostra quali permessi richiede l'app e tu li approvi.</li><li>Epic invia al nostro sito un token di accesso limitato. Identifica il tuo account (nome visualizzato / ID account) — <strong>la tua password non lascia mai i server di Epic</strong>, perché non la digiti mai sul nostro sito.</li></ol><p>Puoi revocare l'accesso in qualsiasi momento: account Epic → <strong>Connessioni → App</strong> → disconnetti l'app.</p>"}, {"q": "Come verifico di trovarmi sulla vera pagina di accesso di Epic?", "a": "<p>Guarda la barra degli indirizzi prima di digitare qualsiasi cosa. L'unico dominio di accesso Epic legittimo è <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> (nota la parte <code>epicgames.com</code> e il lucchetto).</p><p>I domini imitatori — per esempio <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — sono falsi. Se un sito mostra un modulo di accesso <em>sulla sua stessa pagina</em> invece di mandarti a <code>epicgames.com</code>, non digitare nulla. Nel dubbio, apri <code>epicgames.com</code> manualmente e accedi da lì.</p>"}, {"q": "Qualcuno mi ha chiesto la password «per verificare il mio account». Cosa faccio?", "a": "<p>Rifiuta e segnala. Nessun servizio legittimo verifica gli account tramite password.</p><p>Se l'hai già condivisa:</p><ol><li>Cambia subito la password Epic su <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Attiva l'autenticazione a due fattori (vedi sotto).</li><li>Esci da tutte le sessioni: Account → Password e sicurezza → esci ovunque.</li><li>Controlla <strong>Connessioni → App</strong> e rimuovi tutto ciò che non riconosci.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "Cos'è il Token Pirata?", "a": "<p>Il nome usato dalla community per il <strong>Token Pirata (Pirate Shop Access Token)</strong> — la valuta dell'evento della mini-stagione Treasure Hunters. La ottieni raccogliendo casse pirate sepolte (Buried Pirate Chests) di alto livello e la spendi nel negozio a tema pirata. La nostra guida passo a passo si trova in <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Che cos'è l'Ora del Tesoro?", "a": "<p>Una finestra limitata durante la quale il badge Ora del Tesoro (Treasure Hour) va live e le probabilità di casse di alto livello migliorano. Il tracker live è sulla <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">homepage di fortyworth.com</a>; le segnalazioni di orari confermati per regione sono raccolte in <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Come metto in sicurezza il mio account Epic?", "a": "<p>Quattro passaggi, cinque minuti:</p><ol><li>Attiva la 2FA: <code>epicgames.com</code> → accedi → Account → <strong>Password e sicurezza → Autenticazione a due fattori</strong>. Un'app di autenticazione è l'opzione più solida; email e SMS funzionano comunque.</li><li>Usa una password unica che non riutilizi da nessun'altra parte.</li><li>Non inserire la tua password da nessun'altra parte se non su <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Controlla ogni tanto <strong>Connessioni → App</strong> e rimuovi le app che non usi più.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Nessun risultato — prova con una parola più corta.", "checklist_title": "Checklist per la sicurezza dell'account", "cards": [{"title": "1. Non condividere mai la tua password", "text": "Né con «admin», «assistenza», «bot di verifica», streamer o amici. Nessuno di legittimo la chiederà mai."}, {"title": "2. Controlla il dominio", "text": "L'unica vera pagina di accesso Epic è <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>. Tutto il resto che chiede credenziali è falso."}, {"title": "3. Attiva la 2FA", "text": "Account Epic → Password e sicurezza → Autenticazione a due fattori. Un codice 2FA è una chiave per il tuo account — non dirlo mai a nessuno."}, {"title": "4. Controlla le tue connessioni", "text": "Account → Connessioni → App. Disconnetti tutto ciò che non usi o non riconosci."}], "disclaimer": "<strong>Disclaimer:</strong> fortyworth.com è un progetto fan non ufficiale. Non è affiliato, approvato, sponsorizzato o collegato in alcun modo a Epic Games, Inc. «Fortnite», «Epic Games» e i loro loghi sono marchi di Epic Games, Inc.", "footer_guides_label": "Guide e dati della community:", "footer_tracker_label": "Tracker live:", "footer_official_label": "Sito ufficiale di Epic Games:"}, "tr": {"code": "tr", "name": "Türkçe", "html_lang": "tr", "title": "SSS — fortyworth.com (gayriresmî Pirate Token rehberi)", "h1": "Sıkça Sorulan Sorular", "subtitle": "Pirate Token · Treasure Hour · hesap güvenliği", "banner_title": "🔒 Kısa versiyon", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Epic Games şifrenizi asla istemiyoruz</span> — ne bu sitede, ne e-postada, ne de sohbette. Şifre gerektiren bir “hesap doğrulama” işlemi yoktur.", "Giriş işlemi <span class=\"ok\">yalnızca resmî Epic Games sayfasında</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>) standart “Sign in with Epic Games” (OAuth) akışıyla yapılır.", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com, Epic Games değildir.</span> Gayriresmî bir hayran projesidir — Epic Games, Inc. ile bağlantılı değildir; Epic Games, Inc. tarafından onaylanmaz, desteklenmez veya sponsorlanmaz.", "Herhangi bir site, DM veya “yönetici” şifrenizi ya da 2FA kodunuzu isterse — <span class=\"no\">bu bir dolandırıcılıktır</span>. Sayfayı kapatın ve bildirin."], "search_label": "Sorularda arama yapın", "search_placeholder": "örn. şifre, OAuth, 2FA, treasure hour…", "qa": [{"q": "fortyworth.com Epic Games'in bir parçası mı?", "a": "<p>Hayır. fortyworth.com; Fortnite Treasure Hunters etkinliği ve Pirate Shop Access Token etrafında kurulmuş bağımsız, gayriresmî bir hayran projesidir. <strong>Epic Games, Inc. ile hiçbir şekilde bağlantılı değildir; Epic Games, Inc. tarafından onaylanmaz, desteklenmez veya sponsorlanmaz</strong> ve Epic Games adına konuşmaz. “Fortnite” ve “Epic Games”, Epic Games, Inc.'in ticari markalarıdır.</p>"}, {"q": "Herhangi bir şey için Epic Games şifremi vermem gerekiyor mu?", "a": "<p>Hayır — ve şifre gerektiren bir “hesap doğrulama” versiyonu yoktur. Şifre yalnızca <em>siz</em> tarafından, resmî giriş akışı sırasında <em>Epic'in kendi sitesinde</em> yazılır (bir sonraki soruya bakın). Sitemizde hiçbir şifre alanı yoktur ve şifre kabul edemez.</p><p>Şifrenizi veya 2FA kodunuzu teslim etmenizi isteyen herkes — fortyworth'dan, Epic desteğinden veya bir “doğrulama botundan” geldiğini iddia eden biri dahil — <strong>phishing</strong> (oltalama) yapar. Gerçek Epic Games çalışanları da asla istemez.</p>"}, {"q": "“Sign in with Epic Games” nasıl çalışır?", "a": "<p>Binlerce uygulamanın kullandığı resmî mekanizma olan OAuth'ı kullanır:</p><ol><li><strong>Sign in with Epic Games</strong> düğmesine tıklarsınız.</li><li>Tarayıcınız <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> adresine yönlendirilir — resmî Epic Games alan adı. Kimlik bilgilerinizi <strong>orada</strong>, Epic'in sayfasında girersiniz; bizim sitemizde değil.</li><li>Epic, uygulamanın hangi izinleri istediğini sorar ve siz onaylarsınız.</li><li>Epic, sitemize sınırlı bir erişim tokeni gönderir. Bu token hesabınızı tanımlar (görünen ad / hesap kimliği) — <strong>şifreniz Epic'in sunucularından asla çıkmaz</strong>, çünkü onu bizim sitemizde hiç yazmazsınız.</li></ol><p>Erişimi istediğiniz zaman geri alabilirsiniz: Epic hesabı → <strong>Bağlantılar (Connections) → Uygulamalar (Apps)</strong> → uygulamaya ait bağlantıyı kaldırın.</p>"}, {"q": "Gerçek Epic giriş sayfasında olduğumu nasıl kontrol ederim?", "a": "<p>Herhangi bir şey yazmadan önce adres çubuğuna bakın. Tek meşru Epic giriş alan adı <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> adresidir (<code>epicgames.com</code> kısmına ve kilit simgesine dikkat edin).</p><p>Taklit alan adları — örneğin <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — sahtedir. Bir site, sizi <code>epicgames.com</code>'a yönlendirmek yerine <em>kendi sayfasında</em> bir giriş formu gösteriyorsa hiçbir şey yazmayın. Şüpheye düşerseniz <code>epicgames.com</code>'u elle açın ve oradan giriş yapın.</p>"}, {"q": "Birisi “hesabımı doğrulamak için” şifremi istedi. Ne yapmalıyım?", "a": "<p>Reddedin ve bildirin. Hiçbir meşru hizmet hesapları şifrelerle doğrulamaz.</p><p>Şifrenizi zaten paylaştıysanız:</p><ol><li>Epic şifrenizi hemen <code>epicgames.com</code> üzerinde değiştirin.</li><li>İki Faktörlü Kimlik Doğrulamayı (2FA) açın (aşağıya bakın).</li><li>Tüm oturumların çıkışını yapın: Hesap → Şifre ve Güvenlik → her yerden çıkış yapın.</li><li><strong>Bağlantılar → Uygulamalar</strong> bölümünü kontrol edin ve tanımadığınız her şeyi kaldırın.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "Pirate Token nedir?", "a": "<p><strong>Pirate Shop Access Token</strong>'ın — Treasure Hunters mini-sezonunun etkinlik para birimi — topluluk arasındaki adı <strong>Korsan Tokeni</strong>'dir. Üst seviye Gömülü Korsan Sandıklarını açarak kazanırsınız ve korsan temalı mağazada harcarsınız. Adım adım rehberimiz şurada: <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Treasure Hour nedir?", "a": "<p>Treasure Hour rozetinin aktif olduğu ve üst seviye sandık şansının yükseldiği sınırlı süreli bir penceredir. Canlı takip aracı <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">fortyworth.com ana sayfasında</a>dır; bölge başına doğrulanmış program raporları <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a> bölümünde toplanır.</p>"}, {"q": "Epic hesabımı nasıl güvenceye alırım?", "a": "<p>Beş dakikada dört adım:</p><ol><li>2FA'yı açın: <code>epicgames.com</code> → giriş yapın → Hesap → <strong>Şifre ve Güvenlik → İki Faktörlü Kimlik Doğrulama</strong>. En güçlü seçenek bir doğrulayıcı uygulamadır; e-posta ve SMS de çalışır.</li><li>Hiçbir yerde yeniden kullanmadığınız benzersiz bir şifre kullanın.</li><li>Şifrenizi <code>epicgames.com</code> dışında hiçbir yere girmeyin.</li><li>Zaman zaman <strong>Bağlantılar → Uygulamalar</strong> bölümünü gözden geçirin ve artık kullanmadığınız uygulamaları kaldırın.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Aramanızla eşleşen bir şey bulunamadı — daha kısa bir kelime deneyin.", "checklist_title": "Hesap güvenliği kontrol listesi", "cards": [{"title": "1. Şifrenizi asla paylaşmayın", "text": "“Yöneticilerle” de değil, “destekle” de değil, “doğrulama botlarıyla” da değil; yayıncılarla veya arkadaşlarla da değil. Meşru kimse asla istemez."}, {"title": "2. Alan adını kontrol edin", "text": "Tek gerçek Epic giriş sayfası <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> adresidir. Kimlik bilgisi isteyen diğer her şey sahtedir."}, {"title": "3. 2FA'yı açın", "text": "Epic hesabı → Şifre ve Güvenlik → İki Faktörlü Kimlik Doğrulama. 2FA kodu hesabınızın anahtarıdır — kimseye asla söylemeyin."}, {"title": "4. Bağlantılarınızı gözden geçirin", "text": "Hesap → Bağlantılar → Uygulamalar. Kullanmadığınız veya tanımadığınız her şeyin bağlantısını kesin."}], "disclaimer": "<strong>Yasal uyarı:</strong> fortyworth.com gayriresmî bir hayran projesidir. Epic Games, Inc. ile bağlantılı değildir; Epic Games, Inc. tarafından onaylanmaz, desteklenmez veya sponsorlanmaz. “Fortnite”, “Epic Games” ve logoları Epic Games, Inc.'in ticari markalarıdır.", "footer_guides_label": "Rehberler ve topluluk verileri:", "footer_tracker_label": "Canlı takip:", "footer_official_label": "Resmî Epic Games sitesi:"}, "pl": {"code": "pl", "name": "Polski", "html_lang": "pl", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com (nieoficjalny poradnik Pirate Token)", "h1": "Często zadawane pytania", "subtitle": "Pirate Token · Treasure Hour · bezpieczeństwo konta", "banner_title": "🔒 W skrócie", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Nigdy nie prosimy o twoje hasło do Epic Games</span> — ani na tej stronie, ani w mailu, ani na czacie. Nie istnieje żadna „weryfikacja konta” wymagająca hasła.", "Logowanie odbywa się <span class=\"ok\">wyłącznie na oficjalnej stronie Epic Games</span> (<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>), standardowym przepływem „Sign in with Epic Games” (OAuth).", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com to nie Epic Games.</span> To nieoficjalny projekt fanowski — nie jest powiązany z Epic Games, Inc. ani wspierany, sponsorowany czy zatwierdzony przez Epic Games, Inc.", "Jeśli jakakolwiek strona, prywatna wiadomość albo „admin” prosi o twoje hasło lub kod 2FA — <span class=\"no\">to oszustwo</span>. Zamknij stronę i zgłoś to."], "search_label": "Szukaj wśród pytań", "search_placeholder": "np. hasło, OAuth, 2FA, treasure hour…", "qa": [{"q": "Czy fortyworth.com jest częścią Epic Games?", "a": "<p>Nie. fortyworth.com to niezależny, nieoficjalny projekt fanowski zbudowany wokół wydarzenia Fortnite Treasure Hunters i Pirate Shop Access Token. <strong>Nie jest w żaden sposób powiązany z Epic Games, Inc., nie jest przez nią wspierany, sponsorowany ani zatwierdzony</strong> i nie mówi w imieniu Epic Games. „Fortnite” i „Epic Games” to znaki towarowe Epic Games, Inc.</p>"}, {"q": "Czy do czegokolwiek potrzebujecie mojego hasła do Epic Games?", "a": "<p>Nie — i nie istnieje żadna wersja „weryfikacji konta”, która by go wymagała. Hasło wpisuje wyłącznie <em>ty</em>, na <em>własnej stronie Epic</em>, podczas oficjalnego logowania (zobacz następne pytanie). Nasza strona nie ma w ogóle pola na hasło i nie może go przyjąć.</p><p>Jeśli ktokolwiek — w tym ktoś podający się za kogoś z fortyworth, za wsparcie Epic albo za „bota weryfikacyjnego” — prosi cię o przekazanie hasła lub kodu 2FA, to jest <strong>phishing</strong>. Prawdziwi pracownicy Epic Games też nigdy o to nie proszą.</p>"}, {"q": "Jak działa „Sign in with Epic Games”?", "a": "<p>Korzysta z OAuth — tego samego oficjalnego mechanizmu, z którego korzystają tysiące aplikacji:</p><ol><li>Klikasz przycisk <strong>Sign in with Epic Games</strong>.</li><li>Twoja przeglądarka jest przekierowywana na <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> — oficjalną domenę Epic Games. Dane logowania wpisujesz <strong>tam</strong>, na stronie Epic, nie u nas.</li><li>Epic pyta, o jakie uprawnienia prosi aplikacja, a ty je zatwierdzasz.</li><li>Epic wysyła naszej stronie ograniczony token dostępu. Identyfikuje on twoje konto (nazwa wyświetlana / ID konta) — <strong>twoje hasło nigdy nie opuszcza serwerów Epic</strong>, bo nigdy nie wpisujesz go na naszej stronie.</li></ol><p>Dostęp możesz cofnąć w każdej chwili: konto Epic → <strong>Połączenia (Connections) → Aplikacje (Apps)</strong> → odłącz aplikację.</p>"}, {"q": "Jak sprawdzić, czy jestem na prawdziwej stronie logowania Epic?", "a": "<p>Zanim cokolwiek wpiszesz, spójrz na pasek adresu. Jedyną prawdziwą domeną logowania Epic jest <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code> (zwróć uwagę na część <code>epicgames.com</code> i kłódkę).</p><p>Domeny naśladujące Epic — na przykład <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — to fałszywki. Jeśli strona pokazuje formularz logowania <em>na własnej stronie</em> zamiast wysłać cię na <code>epicgames.com</code>, nie wpisuj niczego. W razie wątpliwości otwórz <code>epicgames.com</code> ręcznie i zaloguj się stamtąd.</p>"}, {"q": "Ktoś poprosił o moje hasło „aby zweryfikować konto”. Co mam zrobić?", "a": "<p>Odmów i zgłoś. Żadna prawdziwa usługa nie weryfikuje kont hasłami.</p><p>Jeśli już je udostępniłeś:</p><ol><li>Natychmiast zmień hasło Epic na <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Włącz uwierzytelnianie dwuskładnikowe (zobacz niżej).</li><li>Wyloguj się ze wszystkich sesji: Konto → Hasło i zabezpieczenia → wyloguj wszędzie.</li><li>Sprawdź <strong>Połączenia → Aplikacje</strong> i usuń wszystko, czego nie rozpoznajesz.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "Czym jest Pirate Token?", "a": "<p>Społecznościowa nazwa <strong>Pirate Shop Access Token</strong> — waluty wydarzenia w mini-sezonie Treasure Hunters. Zdobywasz go, odbierając zakopane skrzynie pirackie wyższych poziomów, a wydajesz w sklepie o pirackiej tematyce. Nasz poradnik krok po kroku znajduje się w <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Czym jest Treasure Hour?", "a": "<p>Ograniczone czasowo okno, w którym odznaka Treasure Hour przechodzi na żywo, a szanse na skrzynie wyższego poziomu rosną. Tracker na żywo jest na <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">stronie głównej fortyworth.com</a>; potwierdzone raporty harmonogramu dla poszczególnych regionów zbierane są w <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>.</p>"}, {"q": "Jak zabezpieczyć konto Epic?", "a": "<p>Cztery kroki, pięć minut:</p><ol><li>Włącz 2FA: <code>epicgames.com</code> → zaloguj się → Konto → <strong>Hasło i zabezpieczenia → Uwierzytelnianie dwuskładnikowe</strong>. Najlepszą opcją jest aplikacja uwierzytelniająca; e-mail i SMS też działają.</li><li>Używaj unikalnego hasła, którego nie używasz nigdzie indziej.</li><li>Nigdy nie wpisuj hasła nigdzie poza <code>epicgames.com</code>.</li><li>Od czasu do czasu przeglądaj <strong>Połączenia → Aplikacje</strong> i usuwaj aplikacje, których już nie używasz.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "Nic nie pasuje do Twojego wyszukiwania — spróbuj krótszego słowa.", "checklist_title": "Lista kontrolna bezpieczeństwa konta", "cards": [{"title": "1. Nigdy nie udostępniaj swojego hasła", "text": "Ani „adminom”, ani „supportowi”, ani „botom weryfikacyjnym”, streamerom czy znajomym. Uczciwa osoba nigdy o hasło nie zapyta."}, {"title": "2. Sprawdź domenę", "text": "Jedyną prawdziwą stroną logowania Epic jest <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>. Wszystko inne, co prosi o dane logowania, to fałszywka."}, {"title": "3. Włącz 2FA", "text": "Konto Epic → Hasło i zabezpieczenia → Uwierzytelnianie dwuskładnikowe. Kod 2FA to klucz do twojego konta — nigdy nie mów go nikomu."}, {"title": "4. Przejrzyj swoje połączenia", "text": "Konto → Połączenia → Aplikacje. Odłącz wszystko, czego nie używasz lub czego nie rozpoznajesz."}], "disclaimer": "<strong>Zastrzeżenie:</strong> fortyworth.com to nieoficjalny projekt fanowski. Nie jest powiązany z Epic Games, Inc., nie jest przez nią wspierany, sponsorowany ani zatwierdzony. „Fortnite”, „Epic Games” i ich loga są znakami towarowymi Epic Games, Inc.", "footer_guides_label": "Poradniki i dane społeczności:", "footer_tracker_label": "Tracker na żywo:", "footer_official_label": "Oficjalna strona Epic Games:"}, "ja": {"code": "ja", "name": "日本語", "html_lang": "ja", "title": "よくある質問 — fortyworth.com（非公式 海賊トークンガイド）", "h1": "よくある質問", "subtitle": "海賊トークン · トレジャーアワー · アカウントの安全", "banner_title": "🔒 要点まとめ", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Epic Gamesのパスワードを尋ねることは決してありません</span> — このサイトでも、メールでも、チャットでも。パスワードを要求する「アカウント認証」は存在しません。", "サインインは<span class=\"ok\">公式Epic Gamesページ上でのみ</span>行われます（<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>）。標準の「Epic Gamesでサインイン」（OAuth）フローを使用します。", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.comはEpic Gamesではありません。</span>非公式ファンプロジェクトであり、Epic Games, Inc.とは提携・承認・スポンサード・いかなる関係もありません。", "サイト、DM、「管理者」を名乗る相手からパスワードや2FAコードを求められたら — <span class=\"no\">それは詐欺です</span>。ページを閉じて報告してください。"], "search_label": "質問を検索", "search_placeholder": "例：パスワード、OAuth、2FA、トレジャーアワー…", "qa": [{"q": "fortyworth.comはEpic Gamesの一部ですか？", "a": "<p>いいえ。fortyworth.comは、FortniteのTreasure Huntersイベントと海賊トークン（Pirate Shop Access Token）をめぐる独立した非公式ファンプロジェクトです。<strong>Epic Games, Inc.とは一切提携・承認・スポンサード・関係がなく、Epic Gamesの代理発言も行いません</strong>。「Fortnite」「Epic Games」はEpic Games, Inc.の商標です。</p>"}, {"q": "Epic Gamesのパスワードを何かに使いますか？", "a": "<p>いいえ — パスワードを必要とする「アカウント認証」は、どんな形でも存在しません。パスワードを入力するのは<em>あなた自身</em>で、場所も<em>Epic公式サイト</em>上、公式サインインフローの中だけです（次の質問を参照）。当サイトにはパスワード入力欄がそもそもなく、受け付けることもできません。</p><p>fortyworth関係者、Epicサポート、「認証ボット」を名乗る人物など、誰であれパスワードや2FAコードを渡すよう求めてきたら、それは<strong>フィッシング</strong>です。本物のEpic Gamesスタッフも決して求めません。</p>"}, {"q": "「Epic Gamesでサインイン」はどのように動作しますか？", "a": "<p>OAuthを使用します。何千ものアプリが利用しているのと同じ公式仕組みです：</p><ol><li><strong>Epic Gamesでサインイン</strong>ボタンをクリックします。</li><li>ブラウザが<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code> — 公式Epic Gamesドメイン — へリダイレクトされます。認証情報は<strong>そこ</strong>、Epicのページで入力します。当サイトではありません。</li><li>Epicがアプリの要求する権限を表示し、あなたが承認します。</li><li>Epicが当サイトへ限定アクセストークンを送信します。トークンはアカウント（表示名／アカウントID）を識別するだけです — <strong>パスワードがEpicのサーバーを離れることはありません</strong>。当サイトでパスワードを入力することがないためです。</li></ol><p>アクセスはいつでも取り消せます：Epicアカウント → <strong>接続 → アプリ</strong> → アプリを切断。</p>"}, {"q": "本物のEpicログインページかどうかはどう確認できますか？", "a": "<p>何かを入力する前にアドレスバーを確認しましょう。正当なEpicログインドメインは<code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code>だけです（<code>epicgames.com</code>の部分と鍵マークを確認）。</p><p>類似ドメイン — 例：<code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>、<code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>、<code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — は偽物です。<code>epicgames.com</code>へ誘導せず、サイト自身のページにログインフォームを表示してくる場合は、何も入力しないでください。疑わしいときは、手動で<code>epicgames.com</code>を開いてそこからサインインしましょう。</p>"}, {"q": "「アカウント確認のため」とパスワードを求められました。どうすればいいですか？", "a": "<p>拒否して報告しましょう。正規のサービスがパスワードでアカウントを確認することはありません。</p><p>すでに教えてしまった場合：</p><ol><li><code>epicgames.com</code>で直ちにEpicのパスワードを変更してください。</li><li>二段階認証（2FA）を有効にします（下記参照）。</li><li>すべてのセッションからサインアウト：アカウント → パスワードとセキュリティ → すべてのセッションをサインアウト。</li><li><strong>接続 → アプリ</strong>を確認し、見覚えのないものを削除します。</li></ol>"}, {"q": "海賊トークンとは何ですか？", "a": "<p><strong>海賊ショップアクセストークン（Pirate Shop Access Token）</strong>のコミュニティ呼び名です — Treasure Huntersミニシーズンのイベント通貨。高ティアの埋もれた海賊チェストを回収して獲得し、海賊テーマのショップで使います。手順ガイドは<a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>にあります。</p>"}, {"q": "トレジャーアワーとは何ですか？", "a": "<p>トレジャーアワー（Treasure Hour）バッジが有効になり、高ティアチェストの出現確率が上昇する限定時間帯です。ライブトラッカーは<a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">fortyworth.comのトップページ</a>にあります。地域ごとの確定スケジュール報告は<a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>にまとめられています。</p>"}, {"q": "Epicアカウントを安全にするには？", "a": "<p>4ステップ、5分でできます：</p><ol><li>2FAを有効にする：<code>epicgames.com</code> → ログイン → アカウント → <strong>パスワードとセキュリティ → 二段階認証</strong>。認証アプリが最も強固な選択肢です。メールやSMSも使えます。</li><li>他で使い回していない一意のパスワードを使う。</li><li><code>epicgames.com</code>以外の場所にはパスワードを絶対に入力しない。</li><li><strong>接続 → アプリ</strong>をときどき見直し、使っていないアプリを削除する。</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "検索に一致する質問はありませんでした — もっと短い言葉で試してください。", "checklist_title": "アカウント安全チェックリスト", "cards": [{"title": "1. パスワードは絶対に共有しない", "text": "「管理者」「サポート」「認証ボット」、ストリーマー、友人 — 誰にも渡さないこと。正規の相手が求めてくることは決してありません。"}, {"title": "2. ドメインを確認する", "text": "本物のEpicログインページは<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>だけ。認証情報を求める他のすべてのサイトは偽物です。"}, {"title": "3. 2FAを有効にする", "text": "Epicアカウント → パスワードとセキュリティ → 二段階認証。2FAコードはアカウントの鍵です — 誰にも教えないでください。"}, {"title": "4. 接続アプリを見直す", "text": "アカウント → 接続 → アプリ。使っていない・見覚えのないものは切断しましょう。"}], "disclaimer": "fortyworth.comは非公式ファンプロジェクトです。Epic Games, Inc.とは提携・承認・スポンサード・いかなる関係もありません。「Fortnite」「Epic Games」およびそのロゴはEpic Games, Inc.の商標です。", "footer_guides_label": "ガイドとコミュニティデータ：", "footer_tracker_label": "ライブトラッカー：", "footer_official_label": "Epic Games公式サイト："}, "ko": {"code": "ko", "name": "한국어", "html_lang": "ko", "title": "FAQ — fortyworth.com(비공식 해적 토큰 가이드)", "h1": "자주 묻는 질문", "subtitle": "해적 토큰 · 트레저 아워 · 계정 보안", "banner_title": "🔒 핵심 요약", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">Epic Games 비밀번호를 절대 요구하지 않습니다</span> — 이 사이트에서도, 이메일에서도, 채팅에서도요. 비밀번호가 필요한 “계정 인증”은 존재하지 않습니다.", "로그인은 <span class=\"ok\">공식 Epic Games 페이지에서만</span> 이뤄집니다(<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>). 표준 “Epic Games로 로그인”(OAuth) 절차를 사용합니다.", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com은 Epic Games가 아닙니다.</span> 비공식 팬 프로젝트로, Epic Games, Inc.와는 제휴·승인·스폰서·어떠한 관련도 없습니다.", "어떤 사이트, DM, “관리자”라는 사람이 비밀번호나 2FA 코드를 요구하면 — <span class=\"no\">그건 사기입니다</span>. 페이지를 닫고 신고하세요."], "search_label": "질문 검색", "search_placeholder": "예: 비밀번호, OAuth, 2FA, 트레저 아워…", "qa": [{"q": "fortyworth.com은 Epic Games의 일부인가요?", "a": "<p>아니요. fortyworth.com은 Fortnite Treasure Hunters 이벤트와 해적 토큰(Pirate Shop Access Token)을 다루는 독립적인 비공식 팬 프로젝트입니다. <strong>Epic Games, Inc.와는 어떤 식으로도 제휴, 승인, 스폰서, 관련이 없으며 Epic Games를 대변하지 않습니다</strong>. “Fortnite”와 “Epic Games”는 Epic Games, Inc.의 상표입니다.</p>"}, {"q": "Epic Games 비밀번호가 필요한 일이 있나요?", "a": "<p>없습니다 — 비밀번호를 요구하는 “계정 인증”은 어떤 형태로도 존재하지 않습니다. 비밀번호를 입력하는 사람은 <em>본인</em>뿐이고, 장소도 <em>Epic 공식 사이트</em>에서, 공식 로그인 절차 중에만 그렇습니다(다음 질문 참고). 이 사이트에는 비밀번호 입력창이 아예 없어서 받을 수도 없습니다.</p><p>fortyworth 직원, Epic 지원, “인증 봇”을 자칭하는 사람 등 누가 비밀번호나 2FA 코드를 건네달라고 하면 그것은 <strong>피싱</strong>입니다. 진짜 Epic Games 직원도 절대 요구하지 않습니다.</p>"}, {"q": "“Epic Games로 로그인”은 어떻게 작동하나요?", "a": "<p>OAuth를 사용합니다. 수많은 앱이 쓰는 것과 같은 공식 방식입니다:</p><ol><li><strong>Epic Games로 로그인</strong> 버튼을 클릭합니다.</li><li>브라우저가 <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>(공식 Epic Games 도메인)으로 이동합니다. 자격 증명은 <strong>거기서</strong>, Epic 페이지에서 입력합니다. 우리 사이트가 아닙니다.</li><li>Epic이 앱이 요청하는 권한을 보여주고, 여러분이 승인합니다.</li><li>Epic이 우리 사이트에 제한된 액세스 토큰을 보냅니다. 토큰은 계정(표시 이름/계정 ID)을 식별할 뿐입니다 — <strong>비밀번호가 Epic 서버를 떠나는 일은 없습니다</strong>. 우리 사이트에서 비밀번호를 입력할 일이 없기 때문입니다.</li></ol><p>연결은 언제든 해제할 수 있습니다: Epic 계정 → <strong>연결 → 앱</strong> → 앱 연결 해제.</p>"}, {"q": "진짜 Epic 로그인 페이지인지 어떻게 확인하나요?", "a": "<p>무엇이든 입력하기 전에 주소 표시줄을 보세요. 정상적인 Epic 로그인 도메인은 <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code>뿐입니다(<code>epicgames.com</code> 부분과 자물쇠 표시를 확인).</p><p>비슷하게 생긴 도메인 — 예: <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>, <code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>, <code>fortyworth-login.net</code> — 은 가짜입니다. <code>epicgames.com</code>으로 보내지 않고 사이트 자체 페이지에 로그인 폼을 보여주면 아무것도 입력하지 마세요. 확신이 서지 않으면 <code>epicgames.com</code>을 직접 열어 거기서 로그인하세요.</p>"}, {"q": "“계정 인증을 위해” 비밀번호를 요구받았습니다. 어떻게 해야 하나요?", "a": "<p>거절하고 신고하세요. 정상적인 서비스는 비밀번호로 계정을 인증하지 않습니다.</p><p>이미 알려줬다면:</p><ol><li><code>epicgames.com</code>에서 즉시 Epic 비밀번호를 변경합니다.</li><li>2단계 인증을 켭니다(아래 참고).</li><li>모든 세션에서 로그아웃: 계정 → 비밀번호 및 보안 → 모든 기기에서 로그아웃.</li><li><strong>연결 → 앱</strong>을 확인하고 모르는 항목은 제거합니다.</li></ol>"}, {"q": "해적 토큰이란 무엇인가요?", "a": "<p><strong>해적 상점 접근 토큰(Pirate Shop Access Token)</strong>의 커뮤니티 이름입니다 — Treasure Hunters 미니 시즌의 이벤트 화폐. 고티어 묻힌 해적 상자를 회수해서 얻고 해적 테마 상점에서 씁니다. 단계별 가이드는 <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>에 있습니다.</p>"}, {"q": "트레저 아워란 무엇인가요?", "a": "<p>트레저 아워(Treasure Hour) 배지가 활성화되고 고티어 상자 확률이 좋아지는 한정 구간입니다. 실시간 트래커는 <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">fortyworth.com 홈페이지</a>에 있고, 지역별 확정 일정 제보는 <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>에 모입니다.</p>"}, {"q": "Epic 계정을 어떻게 보호하나요?", "a": "<p>4단계, 5분이면 충분합니다:</p><ol><li>2단계 인증 켜기: <code>epicgames.com</code> → 로그인 → 계정 → <strong>비밀번호 및 보안 → 2단계 인증</strong>. 인증 앱이 가장 강력한 방법이고, 이메일·SMS도 가능합니다.</li><li>다른 곳에 쓰지 않는 고유한 비밀번호를 사용합니다.</li><li><code>epicgames.com</code> 외에는 어디에도 비밀번호를 입력하지 않습니다.</li><li><strong>연결 → 앱</strong>을 가끔 점검하고 더 쓰지 않는 앱은 제거합니다.</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "검색과 일치하는 질문이 없습니다 — 더 짧은 단어로 다시 시도해 보세요.", "checklist_title": "계정 보안 체크리스트", "cards": [{"title": "1. 비밀번호는 절대 공유하지 않기", "text": "“관리자”, “고객 지원”, “인증 봇”, 스트리머, 친구 — 누구에게도요. 정상적인 사람은 절대 요구하지 않습니다."}, {"title": "2. 도메인 확인하기", "text": "진짜 Epic 로그인 페이지는 <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>뿐입니다. 자격 증명을 요구하는 다른 모든 곳은 가짜입니다."}, {"title": "3. 2단계 인증 켜기", "text": "Epic 계정 → 비밀번호 및 보안 → 2단계 인증. 2FA 코드는 계정의 열쇠입니다 — 누구에게도 알려주지 마세요."}, {"title": "4. 연결 앱 점검하기", "text": "계정 → 연결 → 앱. 사용하지 않거나 모르는 앱은 연결 해제하세요."}], "disclaimer": "fortyworth.com은 비공식 팬 프로젝트입니다. Epic Games, Inc.와는 제휴, 승인, 스폰서, 어떠한 관련도 없습니다. “Fortnite”, “Epic Games”와 로고는 Epic Games, Inc.의 상표입니다.", "footer_guides_label": "가이드와 커뮤니티 데이터:", "footer_tracker_label": "실시간 트래커:", "footer_official_label": "Epic Games 공식 사이트:"}, "zh-CN": {"code": "zh-CN", "name": "简体中文", "html_lang": "zh-CN", "title": "常见问题 — fortyworth.com（非官方海盗代币指南）", "h1": "常见问题", "subtitle": "海盗代币 · 寻宝时刻 · 账号安全", "banner_title": "🔒 简明要点", "banner_items": ["<span class=\"ok\">我们绝不会询问你的 Epic Games 密码</span>——本站不会，邮件不会，聊天也不会。不存在需要密码的“账号验证”。", "登录<span class=\"ok\">只在 Epic Games 官方页面</span>进行（<code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>），使用标准的“使用 Epic Games 登录”（OAuth）流程。", "<span class=\"no\">fortyworth.com 不是 Epic Games。</span>它是一个非官方粉丝项目——与 Epic Games, Inc. 无任何隶属、认可、赞助或关联关系。", "任何网站、私信或“管理员”索要你的密码或 2FA 验证码——<span class=\"no\">那就是诈骗</span>。请关闭页面并举报。"], "search_label": "搜索问题", "search_placeholder": "例如：密码、OAuth、2FA、寻宝时刻…", "qa": [{"q": "fortyworth.com 是 Epic Games 的一部分吗？", "a": "<p>不是。fortyworth.com 是围绕 Fortnite Treasure Hunters 活动和海盗代币（Pirate Shop Access Token）建立的独立非官方粉丝项目，<strong>与 Epic Games, Inc. 没有任何隶属、认可、赞助或关联关系，也不代表 Epic Games 发言</strong>。“Fortnite” 和 “Epic Games” 是 Epic Games, Inc. 的商标。</p>"}, {"q": "你们需要我的 Epic Games 密码吗？", "a": "<p>不需要——也不存在任何需要密码的“账号验证”。密码只由<em>你本人</em>在<em>Epic 官方网站</em>上、官方登录流程中输入（见下一问）。本站根本没有密码输入框，也无法接收密码。</p><p>任何人——包括自称来自 fortyworth、Epic 客服或“验证机器人”的人——让你交出密码或 2FA 验证码，都是<strong>钓鱼诈骗</strong>。真正的 Epic Games 工作人员也绝不会索要。</p>"}, {"q": "“使用 Epic Games 登录”是如何运作的？", "a": "<p>它使用 OAuth——成千上万应用在用的同一官方机制：</p><ol><li>点击<strong>使用 Epic Games 登录</strong>按钮。</li><li>浏览器跳转到 <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>——Epic Games 官方域名。你在<strong>那里</strong>、Epic 的页面上输入凭据，而不是在我们的页面上。</li><li>Epic 会显示应用请求的权限，由你批准。</li><li>Epic 向本站发送一个受限访问令牌。它只识别你的账号（显示名称 / 账号 ID）——<strong>你的密码永远不会离开 Epic 的服务器</strong>，因为你从不在本站输入密码。</li></ol><p>可随时撤销授权：Epic 账号 → <strong>连接 → 应用</strong> → 断开应用。</p>"}, {"q": "如何确认自己打开的是真正的 Epic 登录页面？", "a": "<p>输入任何内容之前先看地址栏。唯一合法的 Epic 登录域名是 <code>https://accounts.epicgames.com</code>（注意其中的 <code>epicgames.com</code> 部分和挂锁图标）。</p><p>仿冒域名——例如 <code>ep1c-games-login.com</code>、<code>epicgames.verify-account.xyz</code>、<code>fortyworth-login.net</code>——都是假的。如果一个网站不把你送往 <code>epicgames.com</code>，而是在<em>自己的页面</em>上显示登录表单，什么都不要输入。拿不准时，手动打开 <code>epicgames.com</code> 并从那里登录。</p>"}, {"q": "有人以“验证账号”为名索要我的密码。我该怎么办？", "a": "<p>拒绝并举报。正规服务绝不会通过密码验证账号。</p><p>如果你已经泄露了密码：</p><ol><li>立即在 <code>epicgames.com</code> 更改 Epic 密码。</li><li>开启两步验证（见下文）。</li><li>退出所有会话：账号 → 密码与安全 → 在所有设备上退出登录。</li><li>检查<strong>连接 → 应用</strong>，移除你不认识的任何项目。</li></ol>"}, {"q": "海盗代币是什么？", "a": "<p><strong>海盗商城访问令牌（Pirate Shop Access Token）</strong>的社区叫法——Treasure Hunters 迷你赛季的活动货币。通过收取高阶埋藏海盗宝箱获得，在海盗主题商城中消费。分步攻略见 <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md\">docs/how-to-get-pirate-token-in-fortnite.md</a>。</p>"}, {"q": "寻宝时刻是什么？", "a": "<p>寻宝时刻（Treasure Hour）徽章生效、高阶宝箱概率提升的限定时段。实时追踪器在 <a href=\"https://fortyworth.com\">fortyworth.com 首页</a>；各地区经确认的时间表报告收集在 <a href=\"https://github.com/powerfulrac/fortnite-pirate-token-guide/blob/main/docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md\">docs/treasure-hour-schedule.md</a>。</p>"}, {"q": "如何保护我的 Epic 账号安全？", "a": "<p>四个步骤，五分钟搞定：</p><ol><li>开启两步验证：<code>epicgames.com</code> → 登录 → 账号 → <strong>密码与安全 → 两步验证</strong>。验证器应用最安全；邮箱和短信也可用。</li><li>使用独一无二、别处不复用的密码。</li><li>除 <code>epicgames.com</code> 外，绝不在任何地方输入密码。</li><li>偶尔检查<strong>连接 → 应用</strong>，移除不再使用的应用。</li></ol>"}], "none_found": "没有匹配的问题——请试试更短的关键词。", "checklist_title": "账号安全清单", "cards": [{"title": "1. 永不分享密码", "text": "对“管理员”、“客服”、“验证机器人”、主播或朋友都一样。正规人士绝不会开口索要。"}, {"title": "2. 核对域名", "text": "真正的 Epic 登录页面只有 <code>accounts.epicgames.com</code>。其他任何索要凭据的地方都是假的。"}, {"title": "3. 开启两步验证", "text": "Epic 账号 → 密码与安全 → 两步验证。2FA 验证码是账号的钥匙——绝不告诉任何人。"}, {"title": "4. 检查已连接应用", "text": "账号 → 连接 → 应用。断开你不使用或不认识的一切。"}], "disclaimer": "fortyworth.com 是一个非官方粉丝项目。它与 Epic Games, Inc. 无任何隶属、认可、赞助或关联关系。“Fortnite”、“Epic Games”及其标识均为 Epic Games, Inc. 的商标。", "footer_guides_label": "攻略与社区数据：", "footer_tracker_label": "实时追踪器：", "footer_official_label": "Epic Games 官方网站："}};
